<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= deps_workspace_root (root : string) : string =\n    ?= root |> get_file_name ?|\n    | \"deps\" =>\n        ?= root |> directory_parent ?|\n        | Some parent =>\n            ?= parent |> find_parent Directory (\"spiral\" </> \"workspace\") ?|\n            | Ok outer => outer |> normalize_path\n            | Error _ => root\n        | None => root\n    | _ => root","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := deps_workspace_root (root : string) : string =
      ?= root |> get_file_name ?|
      | "deps" =>
          ?= root |> directory_parent ?|
          | Some parent =>
              ?= parent |> find_parent Directory ("spiral" </> "workspace") ?|
              | Ok outer => outer |> normalize_path
              | Error _ => root
          | None => root
      | _ => root
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

