## fsharp

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ ^ trace_file text : () =\n    run_target \\|\n    | Fsharp => \\ () =>\n        resultm::from_try\n            \\ () =>\n                := assembly_name = env::get_entry_assembly_name ()\n                := guid = date_time::now () |> date_time::new_guid_from_date_time\n                := file_name = assembly_name ++# \"_\" ++# sm'::obj_to_string guid ++# \".txt\"\n\n                := workspace_root = get_workspace_root ()\n                := trace_dir = workspace_root </> \"target/trace\"\n                trace_dir |> create_directory |> ignore\n                := path = trace_dir </> file_name\n                text |> write_all_text_async path |> async::run_synchronously\n            \\ ex =>\n                := ex = ex ()\n                := text = $'$\"file_system.trace_file / ex: %A{!ex}\"'\n                text |> console::write_line\n                text |> trace_file\n                ex\n        |> resultm::get\n    | _ => \\ () => ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ ^ trace_file text : () =
      run_target \|
      | Fsharp => \ () =>
          resultm::from_try
              \ () =>
                  := assembly_name = env::get_entry_assembly_name ()
                  := guid = date_time::now () |> date_time::new_guid_from_date_time
                  := file_name = assembly_name ++# "_" ++# sm'::obj_to_string guid ++# ".txt"

                  := workspace_root = get_workspace_root ()
                  := trace_dir = workspace_root </> "target/trace"
                  trace_dir |> create_directory |> ignore
                  := path = trace_dir </> file_name
                  text |> write_all_text_async path |> async::run_synchronously
              \ ex =>
                  := ex = ex ()
                  := text = $'$"file_system.trace_file / ex: %A{!ex}"'
                  text |> console::write_line
                  text |> trace_file
                  ex
          |> resultm::get
      | _ => \ () => ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

