<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ directory_delete recursive (path : string) : () =\n    run_target_args' (path, recursive) \\|\n        | Fsharp => \\ path, recursive =>\n            ? recursive && delete_target_is_protected path\n            ?> \"file_system.directory_delete: refusing a drive root, profile, temp root or system folder: \" ++# path |> failwith\n            $'System.IO.Directory.Delete (!path, !recursive)'\n        | Rust => \\ path, recursive =>\n            ? recursive && delete_target_is_protected path\n            ?> \"file_system.directory_delete: refusing a drive root, profile, temp root or system folder: \" ++# path |> failwith\n            ? path |> directory_exists ?>\n                ? recursive\n                ?> !\\\\(path, $'\"std::fs::remove_dir_all(&*$0).unwrap()\"')\n                |: !\\\\(path, $'\"std::fs::remove_dir(&*$0).unwrap()\"')\n        | _ => \\ _ => ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ directory_delete recursive (path : string) : () =
      run_target_args' (path, recursive) \|
          | Fsharp => \ path, recursive =>
              ? recursive && delete_target_is_protected path
              ?> "file_system.directory_delete: refusing a drive root, profile, temp root or system folder: " ++# path |> failwith
              $'System.IO.Directory.Delete (!path, !recursive)'
          | Rust => \ path, recursive =>
              ? recursive && delete_target_is_protected path
              ?> "file_system.directory_delete: refusing a drive root, profile, temp root or system folder: " ++# path |> failwith
              ? path |> directory_exists ?>
                  ? recursive
                  ?> !\\(path, $'"std::fs::remove_dir_all(&*$0).unwrap()"')
                  |: !\\(path, $'"std::fs::remove_dir(&*$0).unwrap()"')
          | _ => \ _ => ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

