#### directory_delete_refuses_a_protected_surrogate_root (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n\n:= surrogate = get_temp_path () </> \"spiral-delete-guard-surrogate\"\ncreate_dir_all (surrogate </> \"inner\") |> ignore\n:= before = env::environment_snapshot ()\nenv::environment_restored (before ++# sm'::char_text 0u8 ++# \"LOCALAPPDATA=\" ++# surrogate) \"SPIRAL_KEPT_\"\n:= refused =\n    catch_unwind_rust\n        (\\ () =>\n            directory_delete !+ surrogate\n            !-\n        )\n        \\ _ => !+\nenv::environment_restored before \"SPIRAL_KEPT_\"\n:= kept = surrogate |> directory_exists\ndirectory_delete !+ surrogate\n(refused, kept)\n|> _assert_eq (!+, !+)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust

  := surrogate = get_temp_path () </> "spiral-delete-guard-surrogate"
  create_dir_all (surrogate </> "inner") |> ignore
  := before = env::environment_snapshot ()
  env::environment_restored (before ++# sm'::char_text 0u8 ++# "LOCALAPPDATA=" ++# surrogate) "SPIRAL_KEPT_"
  := refused =
      catch_unwind_rust
          (\ () =>
              directory_delete !+ surrogate
              !-
          )
          \ _ => !+
  env::environment_restored before "SPIRAL_KEPT_"
  := kept = surrogate |> directory_exists
  directory_delete !+ surrogate
  (refused, kept)
  |> _assert_eq (!+, !+)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":~ create_dir dir =\n    run_target_args' dir \\|\n        | Rust => \\ dir =>\n            ?= dir |> create_dir_all |> resultm::map_error' sm'::format' |> resultm::unbox ?|\n            | Ok () =>\n                trace Verbose\n                    \\ () => \"file_system.create_dir\"\n                    \\ () => { dir }\n            | Error error =>\n                trace Critical\n                    \\ () => \"file_system.create_dir\"\n                    \\ () => { dir error }\n            := disposable : _ () = new_disposable \\ () =>\n                dir\n                |> directory_delete !+\n            disposable\n        | _ => \\ _ => null ()\n\n:= create_temp_directory () =\n    := dir = create_temp_path ()\n    dir, dir |> create_dir","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :~ create_dir dir =
      run_target_args' dir \|
          | Rust => \ dir =>
              ?= dir |> create_dir_all |> resultm::map_error' sm'::format' |> resultm::unbox ?|
              | Ok () =>
                  trace Verbose
                      \ () => "file_system.create_dir"
                      \ () => { dir }
              | Error error =>
                  trace Critical
                      \ () => "file_system.create_dir"
                      \ () => { dir error }
              := disposable : _ () = new_disposable \ () =>
                  dir
                  |> directory_delete !+
              disposable
          | _ => \ _ => null ()

  := create_temp_directory () =
      := dir = create_temp_path ()
      dir, dir |> create_dir
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### create_temp_directory (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust -d chrono\n\n:= path, disposable = create_temp_directory ()\n~~\n    path\n    |> directory_exists\n    |> _assert_eq !+\n    disposable |> use |> ignore\n    path\n    |> directory_exists\n    |> _assert_eq !+\npath\n|> directory_exists\n|> _assert_eq !-","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

