<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= rust_try_append_text (path : string) (text : string) : result () string =\n    := opened = rust_append_opened path\n    ? rust_file_opened_ok opened |> not ?> Error \"the file could not be opened\"\n    |:\n        := file = rust_file_of opened\n        ? rust_written_all file text |> rust_io_ok ?> Ok () |: Error \"the write failed\"\n\n:= try_append_all_text (path : string) (text : string) : result () string =\n    run_target_args' (path, text) \\|\n        | Rust => \\ path, text => rust_try_append_text path text\n        | _ => \\ path, text =>\n            append_all_text path text\n            Ok ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := rust_try_append_text (path : string) (text : string) : result () string =
      := opened = rust_append_opened path
      ? rust_file_opened_ok opened |> not ?> Error "the file could not be opened"
      |:
          := file = rust_file_of opened
          ? rust_written_all file text |> rust_io_ok ?> Ok () |: Error "the write failed"

  := try_append_all_text (path : string) (text : string) : result () string =
      run_target_args' (path, text) \|
          | Rust => \ path, text => rust_try_append_text path text
          | _ => \ path, text =>
              append_all_text path text
              Ok ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

